<v Ira Glass>It doesn't matter the genre of the singer is from.
<v Ira Glass>[拉斯卡尔·弗拉茨演唱的《星条旗永不落》] 自由之土上

00:43:23.880 --> 00:43:32.330
<v Ira Glass>["THE STAR-SPANGLED BANNER" BY RASCAL FLATTS] O'er the land of the free
<v Ira Glass>而且就算他们很平稳地唱完歌曲的其他部分也无关紧要。人们会唱到歌的最后部分并做一些完全不同的事情。有时他们会即兴哼唱（scat）或加入自己的歌词。

00:43:32.330 --> 00:43:42.690
<v Ira Glass>And it doesn't matter if they sing the rest of the song fairly straight. People will get to that last part of the song and do something completely different. Sometimes they scat or add their own words.
<v Ira Glass>[史蒂夫·泰勒演唱的《星条旗永不落》] 自由之土上

